{"id":"oVn5uNcU","slug":"hoplite-for-lunar-client","title":"Hoplite for Lunar Client","description":"Tailor-made list of popular mods to enhance your gameplay experience on Hoplite through Lunar Client, including in-game proximity voice chat.","author":"LunarClient","categories":["combat","fabric","multiplayer","optimization"],"display_categories":["combat","multiplayer","optimization"],"client_side":"required","server_side":"unsupported","project_type":"modpack","downloads":1066293,"followers":94,"license":{"id":"MIT","name":"MIT License"},"loaders":["fabric"],"game_versions":["1.20.1","1.21","1.21.8","1.21.11"],"latest_version":"Ensf9uf2","date_created":"2023-11-14T04:54:24.583675Z","date_modified":"2026-04-10T20:55:02.158089Z","updated":"2026-04-10T20:55:02.158089Z","color":328708,"body":"![Lunar Client Download Grid](/launcher-preview/bodies/oVn5uNcU/0.webp)\n\n# Hoplite for Lunar Client\n\n**Hoplite for Lunar Client** is a tailor-made list of popular mods to enhance your gameplay experience, including in-game proximity voice chat. These mods are validated to work with Lunar Client.\n\n_Note: While you're able to use **Hoplite for Lunar Client** on any modpack loader, it's heavily recommended to use it on [**Lunar Client**](https://lunarclient.com/download) to ensure you get the best experience on **Hoplite**._\n\n## Modpack Content\n\n* **Simple Voice Chat**: Proximity voice chat for Minecraft with a variety of features.\n* **Cloth Config API**: Configuration library for Minecraft Mods.\n* **Krypton**: Optimizes in the Minecraft network stack. Reduces memory and CPU usage.\n* **Mod Menu**: Adds a mod menu to view an in-game list of all the mods you have installed.\n* **More Culling**: Prevents the rendering of things you cannot see to improve FPS.\n* **Memory Leak Fix**: Fixes random memory leaks found within vanilla Minecraft.\n* **Sodium Extra**: Adds features found in Optifine to Sodium, like particle and animation settings.\n* **Reese's Sodium Options**: Replaces Sodium's option screen to improve user experience.\n\n## FAQ\n\n<details>\n<summary>What's Hoplite and where can I play it?</summary>\n\nHoplite is a Minecraft server created and owned by [SpeedSilver](https://www.youtube.com/@SpeedSilver). Hoplite offers innovative new games such as Battle Royale and Duels. All of the gamemodes found on Hoplite, contain custom items referred to as \"[Legendary Items](https://www.lunarclient.com/news/mod-loading-on-lunar-client#section-How_to_get_the_Hoplite_Modpack)\". These are unique custom model items, that have special abilities to create a unique combat experience. You can play Hoplite today @ [hoplite.gg](https://hoplite.gg/).\n\nNot sold yet? [Read more](https://www.lunarclient.com/news/why-lunar-client-is-the-best-for-playing-hoplite)!\n\n</details>\n\n<details>\n<summary>How do I launch this on Lunar Client?</summary>\n  \n<center><b>Simple! In three easy steps you can be ready to go!</b></center>\n\n<br>\n\n### Step 1: Download Lunar Client\n[![Lunar Client Download Grid](/launcher-preview/bodies/oVn5uNcU/1.webp)](https://www.lunarclient.com/download)\n\n### Step 2: Open Lunar Client and Click the Hoplite Logo\n[![Launcher Hoplite Quickplay](/launcher-preview/bodies/oVn5uNcU/2.webp)](https://www.lunarclient.com/news/mod-loading-on-lunar-client#section-How_to_get_the_Hoplite_Modpack)\n\n### Step 3: Click \"Launch Modpack\"\n[Launcher Hoplite Mod Prompt](https://www.lunarclient.com/news/mod-loading-on-lunar-client#section-How_to_get_the_Hoplite_Modpack)\n\n</details>\n\n<br>\n\nConnect and create one of a kind experiences and get the latest updates by joining our [Discord](https://lunarclient.com/discord) Community.","published":"2023-11-14T04:54:24.583675Z","additional_categories":[],"issues_url":null,"source_url":null,"wiki_url":null,"discord_url":"https://lunarclient.com/discord","donation_urls":[],"team":[{"username":"LunarClient","role":"Owner","avatar":"/launcher-preview/avatars/LunarClient.webp"}],"versions_to